<title>ITALY: Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>GENOA, July 28 - One tanker waiting for berth, average delay 12 hours.</p>
<p>SAVONA, July 28 - No vessels waiting for normal berth. One vessel waiting for special berth.</p>
<p>LA SPEZIA, July 28 - No vessels waiting for a berth.</p>
</text>
